  "field_opisanie_tovara_1": {
   "value": "<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"104\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"102\">Haier AB71S1LG1FA/1U71S1LR1FA R32 kanal konditsioneri – yashirin o‘rnatish uchun kuchli yechim</strong></h3><p data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"452\"><strong data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"139\">Haier AB71S1LG1FA/1U71S1LR1FA</strong> – bu <strong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"192\">o‘rta quvvatli kanal tipidagi split-sistema</strong> bo‘lib, tijorat va turar-joy binolarida <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"255\">yashirin o‘rnatish</strong> uchun mo‘ljallangan. <strong data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"303\">Invertor texnologiyasi</strong> va <strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"335\">zamonaviy R32 sovutgichi</strong> tufayli u <strong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"387\">energiya tejamkor sovutish va isitish</strong>, shuningdek <strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"428\">minimal shovqin darajasi</strong> bilan ajralib turadi.</p>",
   "format": "full_html",
   "processed": "<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"104\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"102\">Haier AB71S1LG1FA/1U71S1LR1FA R32 kanal konditsioneri – yashirin o‘rnatish uchun kuchli yechim</strong></h3><p data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"452\"><strong data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"139\">Haier AB71S1LG1FA/1U71S1LR1FA</strong> – bu <strong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"192\">o‘rta quvvatli kanal tipidagi split-sistema</strong> bo‘lib, tijorat va turar-joy binolarida <strong data-start=\"233\" data-end=\"255\">yashirin o‘rnatish</strong> uchun mo‘ljallangan. <strong data-start=\"277\" data-end=\"303\">Invertor texnologiyasi</strong> va <strong data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"335\">zamonaviy R32 sovutgichi</strong> tufayli u <strong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"387\">energiya tejamkor sovutish va isitish</strong>, shuningdek <strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"428\">minimal shovqin darajasi</strong> bilan ajralib turadi.</p>"
  },
  "field_opisanie_tovara_2": {
   "value": "<p><strong data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"512\">Yashirin o‘rnatish</strong> – osma shift ortiga joylashtirish uchun ideal.<br><strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"583\">Toza havo oqimi</strong> – mikroiqlimni optimal saqlash uchun tashqi havo aralashtirish funksiyasi.<br><strong data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"689\">Invertor texnologiyasi</strong> – kam energiya sarfi va past shovqin darajasi.<br><strong data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"770\">Korroziyaga qarshi himoya</strong> – xizmat muddatini uzaytiradi.<br><strong data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"829\">Ichki drenaj nasosi</strong> – kondensatni avtomatik ravishda chiqaradi.<br><strong data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"903\">Past shovqin darajasi</strong> – jim rejimda ishlash imkoniyati.<br><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"978\">24 soatlik taymer va avtorestart</strong> – qulay boshqarish va sozlamalarni eslab qolish.<br><strong data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1063\">Namlikni kamaytirish rejimi</strong> – ortiqcha namlikni samarali bartaraf etadi.<br><strong data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1141\">Moslashuvchan sozlamalar</strong> – statik bosimni boshqarish imkoniyati.</p>",
